---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How CallChrist handles your information.">
  <article class="wrap prose" style="padding-top:3rem">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      CallChrist uses Google Analytics (through Google Tag Manager) to understand which pages help people most.
      Google Analytics sets cookies and collects information such as the pages you visit, how long you stay,
      your general location, and your device and browser. We don't use this to identify you personally, and we
      don't run advertising on the site. You can opt out with the
      <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a> or by
      blocking cookies in your browser.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you sign up for the daily email, we store your email address with our email provider, SendFox, only to send you that
      email. We never sell or share it. Every email has an unsubscribe link.
    </p>
    <p>Questions? Contact us at hello@callchrist.com.</p>
    <p><em>Last updated: November 2026.</em></p>
  </article>
</Base>
